---
// Original diagram: front views of high-wing C172 and low-wing PA-28. Angles exaggerated for clarity.
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 720 250" role="img" aria-label="Front view comparison. Cessna 172: high wing on top of the cabin with struts and about 1.7 degrees of dihedral. Piper PA-28-181: low wing under the cabin with about 7 degrees of dihedral.">
  <style>
    .f { fill: var(--surface-2); stroke: var(--ink-2); stroke-width: 2; }
    .w1 { stroke: var(--c172); stroke-width: 7; stroke-linecap: round; }
    .w2 { stroke: var(--pa28); stroke-width: 7; stroke-linecap: round; }
    .st { stroke: var(--ink-3); stroke-width: 2.5; }
    .gd { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
    .t { fill: var(--ink); font: 700 15px var(--font); text-anchor: middle; }
    .s { fill: var(--ink-3); font: 13px var(--font); text-anchor: middle; }
    .a { fill: var(--ink); font: 600 13px var(--font); }
  </style>
  <!-- C172 -->
  <line class="gd" x1="20" y1="78" x2="340" y2="78" />
  <line class="w1" x1="40" y1="70" x2="180" y2="78" /><line class="w1" x1="180" y1="78" x2="320" y2="70" />
  <rect class="f" x="155" y="80" width="50" height="72" rx="16" />
  <line class="st" x1="160" y1="132" x2="95" y2="78" /><line class="st" x1="200" y1="132" x2="265" y2="78" />
  <line class="st" x1="165" y1="152" x2="150" y2="182" /><line class="st" x1="195" y1="152" x2="210" y2="182" />
  <circle cx="148" cy="186" r="7" fill="var(--ink-2)" /><circle cx="212" cy="186" r="7" fill="var(--ink-2)" />
  <text x="250" y="62" class="a" fill="var(--c172)">≈1.7°</text>
  <text x="180" y="218" class="t">Cessna 172: high wing</text>
  <text x="180" y="236" class="s">Small dihedral. CG hangs below the wing.</text>
  <!-- PA-28 -->
  <line class="gd" x1="380" y1="160" x2="700" y2="160" />
  <rect class="f" x="515" y="92" width="50" height="70" rx="16" />
  <line class="w2" x1="400" y1="130" x2="540" y2="160" /><line class="w2" x1="540" y1="160" x2="680" y2="130" />
  <line class="st" x1="490" y1="150" x2="490" y2="184" /><line class="st" x1="590" y1="150" x2="590" y2="184" />
  <circle cx="490" cy="188" r="7" fill="var(--ink-2)" /><circle cx="590" cy="188" r="7" fill="var(--ink-2)" />
  <text x="640" y="122" class="a" fill="var(--pa28)">≈7°</text>
  <text x="540" y="218" class="t">PA-28-181: low wing</text>
  <text x="540" y="236" class="s">More dihedral makes up for the CG sitting above the wing.</text>
</svg>
